 "description": "One-call verdict on a Solana wallet before you deal with it: serial token launcher, fast dumper, trading bot, or clean. Combines the wallet's pump.fun launch history (graduation rate, how fast it sells its own launches) with its trading profile into a risk level and reasons. When to use: Before sending to or trading with a Solana wallet; for full trade stats use pump_wallet (on the MAD Synapse \u00b7 Pump & LP server, https://agent.maddegen.art/hub/mcp/pump). Price: $0.005 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
